      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "戦いは美しい……「自分の攻撃を当てること」、\n「敵の攻撃に当たらぬこと」、必要なのは２つだけ。\n我は射貫く、地平の彼方より真っ直ぐお前の眉間を。\nこの美を体感したくば、是非挑戦しに来られよ。",
        "official_en": "The simplicity of battle is its beauty. In its essence,\nyou need only your shot to hit, and your opponent's\nto miss. Mine will pierce your brow from beyond the\nhorizon. Accept my simple, beautiful challenge.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
